[00:18.62]1. Where would my life be, Jehovah,
[00:23.46]Without you by my side?
[00:29.85]Where else would I go, Jehovah?
[00:34.69]Beneath your wings, I hide.
[00:40.89]Life brings fears, pain, and tears;
[00:46.69]You know I am dust.
[00:52.70]But I know in your love I can trust.
[01:02.40]You are my rock—you’re ever true—
[01:07.90]And I will always trust in you.
[01:13.40]You are my shield, my shelter too;
[01:19.40]With all my heart, I trust in you.
[01:25.40]You have always helped me through.
[01:31.20]Yes, in ev'rything I do, I trust in you.
[01:46.27]2. When I talk to you, Jehovah,
[01:51.16]Your strength and peace, I find.
[01:57.40]When you talk to me, Jehovah,
[02:02.60]You soothe my heart and mind.
[02:08.44]Trials fall on us all
[02:13.94]In these final days.
[02:19.44]But I know in your arms I am safe.
[02:30.24]You are my rock—you’re ever true—
[02:35.74]And I will always trust in you.
[02:41.24]You are my shield, my shelter too;
[02:47.24]With all my heart, I trust in you.
[02:53.24]You have always helped me through.
[02:58.75]Yes, in ev'rything I do, I trust in you.
[03:18.43]You are my rock—you’re ever true—
[03:21.98]And I will always trust in you.
[03:28.98]You are my shield, my shelter too;
[03:34.98]With all my heart, I trust in you.
[03:41.37]You have always helped me through.
[03:46.37]Yes, in ev'rything I do, I trust in you—
[03:51.37]I trust in you.